<!--
  Sample agent claim only — a resource-only JAR shipping
  META-INF/unfurl-catalog.yaml so the catalog scanner can discover this
  agent in the runtime catalog. No Java code; the agent's runtime
  behaviour is encoded entirely by its claim (offers + needs).
-->
